{"4673420": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Chickens. Chickens? Chickens!", "steam_appid": 4673420, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [4747580], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4673420/extras/a4763b448142c3785ce586b96ddf7679.avif?t=1780070282\" width=1232 height=706 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🐓 Fight ridiculous hordes of chickens in a fast, casual arena shooter built for short, chaotic runs. 🐓</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move, dodge, shoot, and survive as wave after wave of angry poultry flood the arena. The controls are simple, the action starts quickly, and every run must last a little longer than the last one!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is designed for quick pick-up-and-play sessions: jump in, clear waves, chase a better score, and try not to get overwhelmed by feathers, beaks, and poor life choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>😮‍💨 Survive the Flock 😮‍💨</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The chickens keep coming.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stay mobile, create space, and react quickly as the arena fills with enemies. Each wave increases the pressure and turns the fight into a messy arcade survival challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎮 <strong>Quick Runs, Fast Restarts </strong>🎮</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No long setup. No complicated systems.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start a run, fight as long as you can, then jump straight back in for another attempt. Ideal for short breaks, Steam Deck sessions, and “one more try” gameplay with  Controller-friendly gameplay.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4673420/extras/a4763b448142c3785ce586b96ddf7679.avif?t=1780070282\" width=1232 height=706 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🐓 Fight ridiculous hordes of chickens in a fast, casual arena shooter built for short, chaotic runs. 🐓</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move, dodge, shoot, and survive as wave after wave of angry poultry flood the arena. The controls are simple, the action starts quickly, and every run must last a little longer than the last one!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is designed for quick pick-up-and-play sessions: jump in, clear waves, chase a better score, and try not to get overwhelmed by feathers, beaks, and poor life choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>😮‍💨 Survive the Flock 😮‍💨</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The chickens keep coming.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stay mobile, create space, and react quickly as the arena fills with enemies. Each wave increases the pressure and turns the fight into a messy arcade survival challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎮 <strong>Quick Runs, Fast Restarts </strong>🎮</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No long setup. No complicated systems.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start a run, fight as long as you can, then jump straight back in for another attempt. Ideal for short breaks, Steam Deck sessions, and “one more try” gameplay with  Controller-friendly gameplay.</p>", "short_description": "🐓 Fight ridiculous chicken hordes in a fast, casual arena shooter. 🐓 Move, dodge, shoot, survive waves, chase a better score, and try not to get buried in feathers.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4673420/a6209e079b8f07bbd05b5b5dc581a5816adfa2f9/header.jpg?t=1780070282", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4673420/3